---
description: motion and 3d rules
globs: ["**/*"]
---

Use animation with intent.

Motion:
- use Motion for UI interactions, hover states, modals, reveals, page entry
- use GSAP for scroll choreography, timelines, pinning, parallax, section reveals
- use Lenis for smooth scrolling
- use React Three Fiber + Drei for 3D hero sections and depth effects

Rules:
- do not animate everything
- prefer layered motion over simple fade/slide defaults
- avoid childish or flashy effects
- use motion to increase perceived value
- keep animations smooth and premium
- on landing pages, include at least one memorable motion sequence